Jaden Smith

Jaden Christopher Syre Smith ya iku salah satunggaling &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; lanang saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; kang lair &lt;a href="8"&gt;8&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané dadi &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; dhèwèké uga bisa nyanyi, nari lan dhèwèké iku anak saka &lt;a href="Will%20Smith"&gt;Will Smith&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jada%20Pinkett"&gt;Jada Pinkett&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké uga duwé adik wadon kang jenenge &lt;a href="Willow%20Smith"&gt;Willow Smith&lt;/a&gt;. Tahun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; dhèwèké wiwit maen &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; bareng bapakne dhéwé ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="The%20Persuit%20of%20Happyness"&gt;The Persuit of Happyness&lt;/a&gt;, lan dhèwèké uga dadi paraga baku ing filem &lt;a href="The%20Day%20the%20Eart%20Stood%20Still"&gt;The Day the Eart Stood Still&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="The%20Karate%20Kid"&gt;The Karate Kid&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Smith miwiti karir artise taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; mawa dadi paraga ing filem &lt;a href="The%20Persuit%20of%20Happyness"&gt;The Persuit of Happyness&lt;/a&gt; mawa Shristopher, putrane Chris Gardner karakter kang diparagani déning &lt;a href="Will%20Smith"&gt;Will Smith&lt;/a&gt;. Saka paraga iku dhèwèké bisa menangake pengargaan kanggo Breaktroug Performance ing &lt;a href="MTV%20Movies%20Award"&gt;MTV Movies Award&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;. Ana ing Academy Award kaping 79, Smith macakake penghargaan the Best Animated Short and the Best Live Action Short sareng calon liyané &lt;a href="Abigael%20Breslin"&gt;Abigael Breslin&lt;/a&gt;. Sabanjure Smith metu manèh mawa Jacob ing filem 2008 ya iku &lt;a href="The%20Day%20the%20Earth%20Stood%20Still%27%27"&gt;The Day the Earth Stood Still"&lt;/a&gt; gawéan balen saka carita kang padha taun &lt;a href="1951"&gt;1951&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing taun &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt;, bareng karo &lt;a href="Jackie%20Chan"&gt;Jackie Chan&lt;/a&gt;, Smith miwiti &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="The%20Karate%20Kid"&gt;The Karate Kid&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; gawéan balen saka filem taun &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;. Smith uga bisa nyanyi mawa lagu-lalgu rap lan tahu kerja bareng &lt;a href="Justin%20Bieber"&gt;Justin Bieber&lt;/a&gt; ing lagu Never Say Never.
Rikala &lt;a href="1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Oktober"&gt;Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2012"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt; Jaden ngluncurake album campuran kang judhule The Cool Cafe.
