Ing tanggal 3 April 2012, sami kaliyan &lt;a href="Baekhyun"&gt;Baekhyun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kai%20%28penyanyi%29"&gt;Kai&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sehun"&gt;Sehun&lt;/a&gt;, Chanyeol tampil ing video musik &lt;a href="Girls%27%20Generation-TTS"&gt;Girls' Generation-TTS&lt;/a&gt; ingkang irah-irahanipun &lt;a href="Twinkle%20%28lagu%29"&gt;Twinkle&lt;/a&gt;.
