HBO

HBO (Home Box Office) ya iku &lt;a href="stasiun%20t%C3%A9l%C3%A9visi"&gt;stasiun télévisi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang diduwèni &lt;a href="Time%20Warner"&gt;Time Warner&lt;/a&gt;. Programé ditayangaké 24 jam sadina marang punjul 40 yuta pelanggan tanpa selingan iklan. Skliyane iku pira-pira produké uga dipasaraké marang punjul 150 nagara.
Nlika 1965, &lt;a href="Charles%20Dolan"&gt;Charles Dolan&lt;/a&gt; éntuk ijin kanggo ngedegaké sistem &lt;a href="tipi%20kabel"&gt;tipi kabel&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Manhattan"&gt;Manhattan&lt;/a&gt;. Sistem iki dijenengi Sterling Manhattan Cable lan kanti panjurung &lt;a href="Time%20Life"&gt;Time Life&lt;/a&gt;, Inc. ngluncuraké Green Channel kang banjur diowah jenengé dadi Home Box Office nalika 8 November 1972. Giyaran perdana HBO ya iku tetandhingan langsung antarané &lt;a href="New%20York%20Rangers"&gt;New York Rangers&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Vancouver%20Canucks"&gt;Vancouver Canucks&lt;/a&gt;, diterusaké déning filem &lt;a href="Sometimes%20a%20Great%20Notion"&gt;Sometimes a Great Notion&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika &lt;a href="28%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;28 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1981"&gt;1981&lt;/a&gt;, HBO wiwit nayangaké acara télévisi 24 jam sadina, 7 dina seminggu. nalika &lt;a href="1983"&gt;1983&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké wiwit gawé filem dhéwé kanti The Terry Fox Story. Saiki pira-pira filem seri produksi HBO ditayangaké déning stasiun télévisi non-kabel ing jaba AS, kaya ta &lt;a href="Sex%20and%20the%20City"&gt;Sex and the City&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Sopranos"&gt;The Sopranos&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Six%20Feet%20Under"&gt;Six Feet Under&lt;/a&gt;.
