Nickelodeon (dikenal uga Nick) ya iku jaringan TV kabel mirunggan kanggo tayangan anak-anak lan praremaja, nanging uga muter program kanggo bocah enom sajeroning blok acara TEENick. Ing awalé amung kasedia ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, nanging saiki wis kasedia ing pira-pira nagara kaya &lt;a href="Asia%20Tenggara"&gt;Asia Tenggara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Selandia%20Baru"&gt;Selandia Baru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Skandinavia"&gt;Skandinavia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20Barat"&gt;Éropa Barat&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Latin"&gt;Amérika Latin&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Nicktoons</h3>
Nicktoons.
Nickelodeon wiwit produksi program kanggo blok acara Nicktoons nalika &lt;a href="1%20Agustus"&gt;1 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt;, dimulai kanti &lt;a href="Doug"&gt;Doug&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika waktu kang ing, &lt;a href="Rugrats"&gt;Rugrats&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ren%20%26amp%3B%20Stimpy"&gt;Ren &amp; Stimpy&lt;/a&gt; uga ditayangaké. Program-program mau ing lumrahé kaloka, nanging &lt;a href="Ren%20%26amp%3B%20Stimpy"&gt;Ren &amp; Stimpy&lt;/a&gt; ora diterusaké ing &lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href="Rugrats"&gt;Rugrats&lt;/a&gt; tetep ditayangaké amarga rating kang terus mundhak. Sebanjuré acara kaya ta &lt;a href="Hey%20Arnold%21"&gt;Hey Arnold!&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Angry%20Beavers"&gt;The Angry Beavers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="SpongeBob%20SquarePants"&gt;SpongeBob SquarePants&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Wow%21%20Wow%21%20Wubbzy%21"&gt;Wow! Wow! Wubbzy!&lt;/a&gt;, digawé lan cukup kaloka, nanging kaya sadurungé, ora diterusaké pira-pira taun, kajaba &lt;a href="Wow%21%20Wow%21%20Wubbzy%21"&gt;Wow! Wow! Wubbzy!&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika wulan Mèi taun &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;, Nickelodeon ngenalaké acarané kang paling kaloka, &lt;a href="SpongeBob%20SquarePants"&gt;SpongeBob SquarePants&lt;/a&gt;. Acara animasi iki dadi kesenengan anak-anak lan wong diwasa ing sekabéhané dunya, kadol milyaran barang kang ngandung unsur acara iki, lan dadi icon budaya pop. Banjur Nicktoons muter uga, &lt;a href="Invader%20ZIM"&gt;Invader ZIM&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Fairly%20OddParents"&gt;The Fairly OddParents&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Danny%20Phantom."&gt;Danny Phantom.&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Nick at Nite</h3>
Nick at Nite.
Nick at Nite ya iku blok acara kang dimulai nalika &lt;a href="1985%23Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt; ing Nickelodeon saka jam tayang utama nganti subuh. Ing permulaané muter program-program klasik kaya ta &lt;a href="The%20Donna%20Reed%20Show"&gt;The Donna Reed Show&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mr.%20Ed"&gt;Mr. Ed&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="My%20Three%20Sons"&gt;My Three Sons&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Alfred%20Hitchcock%20Hour"&gt;The Alfred Hitchcock Hour&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Route%2066"&gt;Route 66&lt;/a&gt;. Ahir-ahir blok acara iki uga muter pira-pira sitkom saka taun 1970an, 1980an, lan 1990an, kayat &lt;a href="The%20Cosby%20Show"&gt;The Cosby Show&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Roseanne"&gt;Roseanne&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Full%20House"&gt;Full House&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="A%20Different%20World"&gt;A Different World&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="The%20Fresh%20Prince%20of%20Bel%20Air"&gt;The Fresh Prince of Bel Air&lt;/a&gt;. Nick at Nite uga produksi program dhéwé kaya ta &lt;a href="Fatherhood"&gt;Fatherhood&lt;/a&gt; (animasi andhedhasar buku karya &lt;a href="Bill%20Cosby"&gt;Bill Cosby&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Hi-Jinks"&gt;Hi-Jinks&lt;/a&gt;. Blok acara iki dikenal kanti Nick Comedy ing Nick Jerman. Ing pertengahan akir 1990an, acara kaya &lt;a href="I%20Love%20Lucy"&gt;I Love Lucy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Mary%20Tyler%20Moore%20Show"&gt;The Mary Tyler Moore Show&lt;/a&gt;, lan acara-acara kang saiki digiyaraké ing &lt;a href="TV%20Land"&gt;TV Land&lt;/a&gt; bityèn ditayangaké ing Nick at Nite.
<h3>Nick Jr.</h3>
Nick Jr..
Ing akir 1980an, program-program ing wektu awan ing mligi kanggo penonton kang umuré isih énom. Ing &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;, salah sijiné blok acara disiapaké, lan dijenengi Nick Jr. Sakdawané taun, blok acara iki nayangaké acara kayat &lt;a href="Pinwheel"&gt;Pinwheel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bob%20the%20Builder"&gt;Bob the Builder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Blue%27s%20Clues"&gt;Blue's Clues&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Dora%20the%20Explorer"&gt;Dora the Explorer&lt;/a&gt;. Nick Jr. tetep ditayangaké ing Nickelodeon nganti saiki.
