apura&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sri%20Lanka"&gt;Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Uruguay"&gt;Uruguay&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Venezuela"&gt;Venezuela&lt;/a&gt;. Nickelodeon didegake ing Britania Raya ing &lt;a href="1%20September"&gt;1 September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Britania Raya uga ditambah knti saluran tambahan kang karan Nick Junior.
