bentuk lan kayu &lt;a href="Paraserianthes%20falcataria"&gt;Paraserianthes falcataria&lt;/a&gt; persis wujud karo wit sengon iki, saéngga jenenge asring dipadhaake. déning wong &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt;, P. falcataria —kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Maluku"&gt;Maluku&lt;/a&gt; — karan kanthi jeneng sengon laut, sengon sabrang, utawa sengon landi.
